supermon-ng (4.3.5-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix clean apt install leaving the packaged allmon.ini placeholder in place.
    The .deb ships example nodes 1998/1999 as a conffile; postinst previously
    used --if-missing and skipped Asterisk generation whenever that file
    already existed.
  * Fresh install now always runs generate_local_allmon.php --force (backs up
    the template, writes nodes/AMI from rpt.conf + manager.conf).
  * Upgrades replace allmon.ini when it still matches the unused stock
    placeholder, so broken 4.3.4 clean installs are repaired automatically.
  * Run allmon generation after Composer vendor is ensured so autoload works.
  * Docs: clarify fresh-install allmon.ini behavior in docs/DEBIAN.md.

